  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 6 - 10 × 8 ÷ 5 + 7 = 15\n\nSo, after interchanging two signs :\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and -\n\n6 - 10 × 8 ÷ 5 + 7 = 15 ⇒ 6 + 10 × **8 ÷ 5**__ - 7 = 15\n\n6 + __**10 × **__**__1.6__** - 7 = 15\n\n__**6 + **16__ - 7 = 15\n\n__**22 - 7**__ = 15\n\n**15 = 15 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷ and -\n\n6 - 10 × 8 ÷ 5 + 7 = 15 ⇒ **6 ÷ 10**__ × 8 - 5 + 7 = 15\n\n__**0.6 × 8**__ - 5 + 7 = 15\n\n__**4.8 + 7**__ - 5 = 15\n\n__**11.8 - 5**__ = 15\n\n6.8 ≠ 15 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and ÷ \n\n6 - 10 × 8 ÷ 5 + 7 = 15 ⇒ 6 - 10 × 8 + **5 ÷ 7**__ = 15\n\n6 - __**10 × 8**__ + 0.71 = 15\n\n__**6 + 0.71**__ - 80 = 15\n\n__**6.71 - 80**__ = 15\n\n-73.29 ≠ 15 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : × and ÷ \n\n6 - 10 × 8 ÷ 5 + 7 = 15 ⇒ 6 - **10 ÷ 8**__ × 5 + 7 = 15\n\n6 - __1.25____** × 5**__ + 7 = 15\n\n__**6 + 7**__ - 6.25 = 15\n\n__**13 - 6.25**__ = 15\n\n6.75 ≠ 15 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
